exports[`renderDesign > renders the reading-list design 1`] = `
"# Shelf: design

Audience: People who read a lot and lose track of what they meant to read next. Feels calm, literary, quiet, warm; copy is plain, warm, second person.

- Density comfortable, radius 8px surfaces and 6px controls, focus ring halo, imagery icons.
- Fonts: Inter for text, Playfair Display for headings, JetBrains Mono for code.
- Style minimal and bookish, light and dark; brand hue 200, muted; page background linear-gradient(180deg, #FDFBF7 0%, #F6F1E8 100%); frame hue 200, muted.
- Wireframes of every screen at desktop width: \`02-design/08-wireframes.html\`.

